[[{"t":"比丘<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00112.gif\" alt=\"𡰱\" title=\"𡰱\" />羯磨法","level":0},{"t":"结界法第一","level":0},{"t":"注曰其诸结界羯磨作法一与上大僧同唯称<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00112.gif\" alt=\"𡰱\" title=\"𡰱\" />大姉为异。","level":0},{"t":"受<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/21/CB21061.gif\" alt=\"𢦶\" title=\"𢦶\" />法第二","level":0},{"t":"比丘<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00112.gif\" alt=\"𡰱\" title=\"𡰱\" />乞畜众羯磨　注曰若比丘<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00112.gif\" alt=\"𡰱\" title=\"𡰱\" />欲度人者当往比丘<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00112.gif\" alt=\"𡰱\" title=\"𡰱\" />僧中偏露右肩脱革屣礼僧足已右膝著地合掌乞畜众羯磨作如是白　大姉僧听我比丘<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00112.gif\" alt=\"𡰱\" title=\"𡰱\" />某甲今从僧乞度人授具足<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/21/CB21061.gif\" alt=\"𢦶\" title=\"𢦶\" />愿僧听我度人授人授具足<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/21/CB21061.gif\" alt=\"𢦶\" title=\"𢦶\" />　注曰如是三说　与畜众羯磨文　大德僧听此比丘<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00112.gif\" alt=\"𡰱\" title=\"𡰱\" />某甲今从僧乞度人授人具足<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/21/CB21061.gif\" alt=\"𢦶\" title=\"𢦶\" />若僧时到僧忍听僧今听比丘<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00112.gif\" alt=\"𡰱\" title=\"𡰱\" />某甲度人授人具足<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/21/CB21061.gif\" alt=\"𢦶\" title=\"𢦶\" />白如是　大姉僧听此比丘<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00112.gif\" alt=\"𡰱\" title=\"𡰱\" />某甲今从僧乞度人授人具足<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/21/CB21061.gif\" alt=\"𢦶\" title=\"𢦶\" />僧今听比丘<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00112.gif\" alt=\"𡰱\" title=\"𡰱\" />某甲度人授人具足<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/21/CB21061.gif\" alt=\"𢦶\" title=\"𢦶\" />谁诸大姉忍僧听比丘<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00112.gif\" alt=\"𡰱\" title=\"𡰱\" />某甲度人授人具足<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/21/CB21061.gif\" alt=\"𢦶\" title=\"𢦶\" />者嘿然谁不忍者说僧已忍听比丘<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00112.gif\" alt=\"𡰱\" title=\"𡰱\" />某甲度人授人具足<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/21/CB21061.gif\" alt=\"𢦶\" title=\"𢦶\" />竟僧忍嘿然故是事如是持度沙弥<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00112.gif\" alt=\"𡰱\" title=\"𡰱\" />文　注曰若在寺内剃发者应白一切僧若不和合应房房语令知若和合应作白然后与剃发应作如是言　大姉僧听此某甲欲从某甲求剃发若僧时到僧忍听为某甲剃发白如是　注曰白已为剃发欲在寺内出家者应白一切僧若不和合应房房令知若和合应作白然后与出家应作如是白　大姉僧听此某甲欲从某甲求出家若僧时到僧忍听与某甲出家白如是　注曰应作如是出家教出家者著袈裟已偏露右肩脱革屣右膝著地合掌教作如是言　我阿姨某甲归依佛归依法归依僧我今随佛出家和上<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00112.gif\" alt=\"𡰱\" title=\"𡰱\" />某甲如来无所著等正觉是我世尊　注曰如是三说　我阿姨某甲归依佛竟归依法竟归依僧竟我今随佛出家竟和上<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00112.gif\" alt=\"𡰱\" title=\"𡰱\" />某甲如来无所著等正觉是我世尊　注曰如是三说　说如是已应与受<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/21/CB21061.gif\" alt=\"𢦶\" title=\"𢦶\" />　尽形寿不得煞生是沙弥<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/21/CB21061.gif\" alt=\"𢦶\" title=\"𢦶\" />能持不　注曰荅言能　尽形寿不得偷盗是沙弥<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00112.gif\" alt=\"𡰱\" title=\"𡰱\" /><img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/21/CB21061.gif\" alt=\"𢦶\" title=\"𢦶\" />能持不　注曰荅言能　尽形寿不得婬欲是沙弥<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00112.gif\" alt=\"𡰱\" title=\"𡰱\" /><img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/21/CB21061.gif\" alt=\"𢦶\" title=\"𢦶\" />能持不　注曰荅言能　尽形寿不得妄语是沙弥<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00112.gif\" alt=\"𡰱\" title=\"𡰱\" /><img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/21/CB21061.gif\" alt=\"𢦶\" title=\"𢦶\" />能持不　注曰荅言能　尽形寿不得饮酒是沙弥<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00112.gif\" alt=\"𡰱\" title=\"𡰱\" /><img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/21/CB21061.gif\" alt=\"𢦶\" title=\"𢦶\" />能持不　注曰荅言能　尽形寿不得著华鬘香涂身是沙弥<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00112.gif\" alt=\"𡰱\" title=\"𡰱\" /><img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/21/CB21061.gif\" alt=\"𢦶\" title=\"𢦶\" />能持不　注曰荅言能　尽形寿不得歌儛唱伎及往观听（比丘<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00112.gif\" alt=\"𡰱\" title=\"𡰱\" />羯磨经第一石背）是沙弥<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00112.gif\" alt=\"𡰱\" title=\"𡰱\" /><img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/21/CB21061.gif\" alt=\"𢦶\" title=\"𢦶\" />能持不　注曰荅言能　尽形寿不得高广大床上坐是沙弥<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00112.gif\" alt=\"𡰱\" title=\"𡰱\" /><img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/21/CB21061.gif\" alt=\"𢦶\" title=\"𢦶\" />能持不　注曰荅言能　尽形寿不得非时食是沙弥<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00112.gif\" alt=\"𡰱\" title=\"𡰱\" /><img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/21/CB21061.gif\" alt=\"𢦶\" title=\"𢦶\" />能持不　注曰荅言能　尽形寿不得捉持生像金银宝物是沙弥<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00112.gif\" alt=\"𡰱\" title=\"𡰱\" /><img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/21/CB21061.gif\" alt=\"𢦶\" title=\"𢦶\" />能持不　注曰荅言能　如是沙弥<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00112.gif\" alt=\"𡰱\" title=\"𡰱\" />十<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/21/CB21061.gif\" alt=\"𢦶\" title=\"𢦶\" />尽形寿不得犯能持不　注曰荅言能　汝已受<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/21/CB21061.gif\" alt=\"𢦶\" title=\"𢦶\" />竟当供养三宝佛宝法宝僧宝当修三业坐禅诵经劝助众事　注曰听童女十八者二年学<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/21/CB21061.gif\" alt=\"𢦶\" title=\"𢦶\" />年满二十二部僧中受大<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/21/CB21061.gif\" alt=\"𢦶\" title=\"𢦶\" />若年十岁曾出适者听二年学<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/21/CB21061.gif\" alt=\"𢦶\" title=\"𢦶\" />年满十二与受大<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/21/CB21061.gif\" alt=\"𢦶\" title=\"𢦶\" />应如是与二岁学<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/21/CB21061.gif\" alt=\"𢦶\" title=\"𢦶\" />　式叉摩<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/01/CB01057.gif\" alt=\"𨚗\" title=\"𨚗\" />受六法文　注曰沙弥应往比丘<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00112.gif\" alt=\"𡰱\" title=\"𡰱\" />众中偏露右肩脱革屣礼比丘<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00112.gif\" alt=\"𡰱\" title=\"𡰱\" />僧足已右膝著地合掌白如是言　大姉僧听我沙弥<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00112.gif\" alt=\"𡰱\" title=\"𡰱\" />某甲今从僧乞二岁学<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/21/CB21061.gif\" alt=\"𢦶\" title=\"𢦶\" />和上<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00112.gif\" alt=\"𡰱\" title=\"𡰱\" />某甲愿僧济度我慈愍故与我二岁学<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/21/CB21061.gif\" alt=\"𢦶\" title=\"𢦶\" />　注曰如是三说应将沙弥<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00112.gif\" alt=\"𡰱\" title=\"𡰱\" />至离闻处著见处众中应著堪能作羯磨者如上应作白言　大姉僧听此某甲沙弥<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00112.gif\" alt=\"𡰱\" title=\"𡰱\" />今从僧乞二岁学<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/21/CB21061.gif\" alt=\"𢦶\" title=\"𢦶\" />和上<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00112.gif\" alt=\"𡰱\" title=\"𡰱\" />某甲若僧时到僧忍听僧今与某甲沙弥<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00112.gif\" alt=\"𡰱\" title=\"𡰱\" />二岁学<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/21/CB21061.gif\" alt=\"𢦶\" title=\"𢦶\" />和上<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00112.gif\" alt=\"𡰱\" title=\"𡰱\" />某甲白如是　大姉僧听此某甲沙弥<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00112.gif\" alt=\"𡰱\" title=\"𡰱\" />今从僧乞二岁学<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/21/CB21061.gif\" alt=\"𢦶\" title=\"𢦶\" />和上<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00112.gif\" alt=\"𡰱\" title=\"𡰱\" />某甲僧今与某甲沙弥<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00112.gif\" alt=\"𡰱\" title=\"𡰱\" />二岁学<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/21/CB21061.gif\" alt=\"𢦶\" title=\"𢦶\" />和上<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00112.gif\" alt=\"𡰱\" title=\"𡰱\" />某甲谁诸大姉忍僧与某甲沙弥<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00112.gif\" alt=\"𡰱\" title=\"𡰱\" />二岁学<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/21/CB21061.gif\" alt=\"𢦶\" title=\"𢦶\" />和上<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00112.gif\" alt=\"𡰱\" title=\"𡰱\" />某甲者嘿然谁不忍者说是初羯磨　注曰如是三说　僧已忍与某甲沙弥<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00112.gif\" alt=\"𡰱\" title=\"𡰱\" />二岁学<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/21/CB21061.gif\" alt=\"𢦶\" title=\"𢦶\" />和上<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00112.gif\" alt=\"𡰱\" title=\"𡰱\" />某甲竟僧忍嘿然故是事如是持　注曰应如是与六法　某甲谛听如来无所著等正觉说六法不得犯不净行行婬欲法若式叉摩<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/01/CB01057.gif\" alt=\"𨚗\" title=\"𨚗\" />行婬欲法非式叉摩<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/01/CB01057.gif\" alt=\"𨚗\" title=\"𨚗\" />非释种女与染污心男子共身相摩触<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/04/CB04130.gif\" alt=\"𡙇\" title=\"𡙇\" /><img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/21/CB21061.gif\" alt=\"𢦶\" title=\"𢦶\" />应更与受<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/21/CB21061.gif\" alt=\"𢦶\" title=\"𢦶\" />是中尽形寿不得犯能持不　注曰荅言能　不得偷盗乃至草叶若式叉摩<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/01/CB01057.gif\" alt=\"𨚗\" title=\"𨚗\" />取人五钱若过五钱若自取教人取若自斫教人斫若自破教人破若烧若埋若坏色非式叉摩<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/01/CB01057.gif\" alt=\"𨚗\" title=\"𨚗\" />非释种女若取减五钱<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/04/CB04130.gif\" alt=\"𡙇\" title=\"𡙇\" /><img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/21/CB21061.gif\" alt=\"𢦶\" title=\"𢦶\" />应更与受<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/21/CB21061.gif\" alt=\"𢦶\" title=\"𢦶\" />是中尽形寿不得犯能持不　注曰荅言能不得故断众生命乃至蚁子若式叉摩<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/01/CB01057.gif\" alt=\"𨚗\" title=\"𨚗\" />故自手断人命求刀授与人教死劝死赞死与人非药堕胎厌祷呪术自作教人作者非式叉摩<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/01/CB01057.gif\" alt=\"𨚗\" title=\"𨚗\" />非释种女若断畜生不能变化者命<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/04/CB04130.gif\" alt=\"𡙇\" title=\"𡙇\" /><img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/21/CB21061.gif\" alt=\"𢦶\" title=\"𢦶\" />应更与受<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/21/CB21061.gif\" alt=\"𢦶\" title=\"𢦶\" />是中尽形寿不得犯能持不　注曰荅言能　不得妄语乃至戏<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/01/CB01510.gif\" alt=\"𭉋\" title=\"𭉋\" />若式叉摩<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/01/CB01057.gif\" alt=\"𨚗\" title=\"𨚗\" />不真实非己有自称言得上人法言得禅得解脱得三昧正受得湏陁洹果斯陁含果阿<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/01/CB01057.gif\" alt=\"𨚗\" title=\"𨚗\" />含果阿罗汉果言天来龙来鬼神来供养我此非式叉摩<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/01/CB01057.gif\" alt=\"𨚗\" title=\"𨚗\" />非释种女若於众中故作妄语<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/04/CB04130.gif\" alt=\"𡙇\" title=\"𡙇\" />应更与受<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/21/CB21061.gif\" alt=\"𢦶\" title=\"𢦶\" />是中尽形寿不得犯能持不　注曰荅言能　不得非时食若式叉摩<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/01/CB01057.gif\" alt=\"𨚗\" title=\"𨚗\" />非时食犯<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/21/CB21061.gif\" alt=\"𢦶\" title=\"𢦶\" />应更与受<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/21/CB21061.gif\" alt=\"𢦶\" title=\"𢦶\" />是中尽形寿不得犯能持不　注曰荅言能　不得饮酒若式叉摩<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/01/CB01057.gif\" alt=\"𨚗\" title=\"𨚗\" />饮酒犯<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/21/CB21061.gif\" alt=\"𢦶\" title=\"𢦶\" />应更与受<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/21/CB21061.gif\" alt=\"𢦶\" title=\"𢦶\" />是中尽形寿不得犯能持不　注曰荅言能　式叉摩<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/01/CB01057.gif\" alt=\"𨚗\" title=\"𨚗\" />於一切<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00112.gif\" alt=\"𡰱\" title=\"𡰱\" /><img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/21/CB21061.gif\" alt=\"𢦶\" title=\"𢦶\" />中应学除为比丘<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00112.gif\" alt=\"𡰱\" title=\"𡰱\" />过食自受食食式叉摩<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/01/CB01057.gif\" alt=\"𨚗\" title=\"𨚗\" />受大<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/21/CB21061.gif\" alt=\"𢦶\" title=\"𢦶\" />法　注曰若式叉摩<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/01/CB01057.gif\" alt=\"𨚗\" title=\"𨚗\" />学<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/21/CB21061.gif\" alt=\"𢦶\" title=\"𢦶\" />已年满廿若满十二应与受大<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/21/CB21061.gif\" alt=\"𢦶\" title=\"𢦶\" />先至比丘<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00112.gif\" alt=\"𡰱\" title=\"𡰱\" />僧中请和上应如是说言　大姉一心念我某甲求阿姨为和上愿阿姨为我作和上我依阿姨故得受大<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/21/CB21061.gif\" alt=\"𢦶\" title=\"𢦶\" />　注曰如是三说和上<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/00/CB00112.gif\" alt=\"𡰱\" title=\"𡰱\" />应荅言　尓　注曰应如是受<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/21/CB21061.gif\" alt=\"𢦶\" title=\"𢦶\" />人离闻处著见处应差教授师是<img class=\"gaiji\" src=\"asset://gaiji-CB/21/CB21061.gif\" alt=\"𢦶\" title=\"𢦶\" />师应如是问言　此众中谁能为某甲作教授师　注曰若有者荅言我能尓时<img class=\"gaij